Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Anticausal Vestige.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Swords to Plowshares.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Anticausal Vestige)
Bot1.Pass
